# Rules for AI assistants working on this project

## Architecture
- Every concrete storage class must implement an interface from src/storage/interfaces.py
- Services depend on interfaces only, never on concrete implementations
- No external databases, APIs or file-system persistence; all storage is in-memory

## Code style
- Write tests before implementation (TDD)
- Each test file mirrors its source: src/services/x.py -> tests/unit/test_x.py
- Use pytest and pytest-cov only
- Custom exceptions live in src/utils/exceptions.py
- IDs are generated via src/utils/id_generator.py

## Patterns
- Event sorting/filtering: Strategy pattern (src/services/sort_strategies.py)
- Platform notifications: Observer pattern (src/services/observer.py)

## Coverage
- Minimum 70%, target 80%+
- Every exception path must have a test
